flowchart LR
    N[Immutable native-production root] --> V[verify-native replay<br/>pinned Ed25519 trust root]
    NO[NativeProductionObservation v3<br/>retirement identity + terminal authority] --> V
    L[Immutable legacy archive root] --> F[verify-final-state replay<br/>archive + raw source reconciliation]
    AM[LegacyArchiveManifest v2] --> F
    FS[LegacyFinalState v2] --> F
    P[Frozen retirement and scan policies] --> V
    P --> F

    V --> A[assemble-readiness]
    F --> A
    A --> C{Same retirement identity,<br/>authority active, final state current?}
    C -- no --> X[Fail closed<br/>no observation or report]
    C -- yes --> O[Canonical RetirementReadinessObservation]
    O --> R[evaluate-readiness<br/>replays both roots again]
    R --> G{All 14 gates pass?}
    G -- no --> H[Not ready<br/>no action authority]
    G -- yes --> W[AWAITING STOP APPROVAL]

    B[No wallet, broker, exchange, network,<br/>signer, PM2, stop, pause or delete capability] -. security boundary .- A
